From: Oreon Packaging Team <packaging@oreonhq.com>
Date: Fri, 08 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] tests: expect R(ABI) 4.6 for current R-core

Upstream golden output still pins 4.5; Oreon 11 build roots ship R 4.6.
---
 tests/test-R-deps.sh.out | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tests/test-R-deps.sh.out b/tests/test-R-deps.sh.out
--- a/tests/test-R-deps.sh.out
+++ b/tests/test-R-deps.sh.out
@@ -8,7 +8,7 @@
 # Depends
 R-core >= 4.1.0
-R(ABI) = 4.5
+R(ABI) = 4.6
 R(errors) >= 0.4.0
 R(units) >= 0.8.0
 
 # Imports
@@ -53,7 +53,7 @@
 # Depends Imports
 R-core >= 4.1.0
-R(ABI) = 4.5
+R(ABI) = 4.6
 R(brio) >= 1.1.5
 R(callr) >= 3.7.6
 R(cli) >= 3.6.5
 R(desc) >= 1.4.3
